// Chapter 10: Object-Oriented Programming & Classes

Heading { text -> `10. Object-Oriented Programming & Classes`, size -> 1 },

Paragraph {
    text -> `Zenlang supports object-oriented modeling with classes, constructors, methods, and single inheritance:`
},

CodeBlock {
    language -> `zen`,
    code -> ```
        class Animal {
            init(name) {
                set this.name -> name
            }
            
            speak() {
                <- "Some generic animal sound"
            }
        }
        
        class Dog extends Animal {
            init(name, breed) {
                this.super(name)
                set this.breed -> breed
            }
            
            speak() {
                <- "Woof! My name is " + this.name
            }
        }
    ```
},

HorizontalRule { symbol -> `*` }
